---
const questions = [
  '¿Qué tienen en la carta?',
  '¿Dónde está?',
  '¿Está abierto?',
  '¿Puedo reservar?',
  '¿Cómo contacto?',
];
---

<section class="customer-questions" aria-labelledby="customer-questions-heading">
  <div class="customer-questions__inner">
    <div>
      <h2 id="customer-questions-heading" class="customer-questions__heading">
        Tu cliente no entra en tu web para admirarla.
      </h2>
      <p class="customer-questions__statement">Entra porque está buscando algo.</p>
      <p class="customer-questions__copy">
        Una buena web responde a esas preguntas rápidamente. La carta, el horario,
        la ubicación y las formas de reservar o contactar deben ser fáciles de
        encontrar y de entender.
      </p>
    </div>
    <ul class="customer-questions__list" aria-label="Preguntas de quien visita la web de un local">
      {questions.map((question) => <li>{question}</li>)}
    </ul>
    <p class="customer-questions__closing">Menos buscar. Más decidir.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .customer-questions {
    padding: 56px 20px;
    background: #F4F0E8;
    color: #2E2019;
  }

  .customer-questions__inner {
    max-width: 1360px;
    margin-inline: auto;
    display: grid;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 28px;
  }

  .customer-questions__heading {
    max-width: 600px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    font-size: 32px;
    font-weight: 300;
    line-height: 1.08;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }

  .customer-questions__statement {
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    font-size: 23px;
    font-weight: 300;
    line-height: 1.3;
    letter-spacing: -0.015em;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }

  .customer-questions__copy {
    max-width: 520px;
    color: #6B5E52;
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 300;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  .customer-questions__closing {
    font-size: 23px;
    font-weight: 300;
    line-height: 1.3;
    letter-spacing: -0.015em;
  }

  .customer-questions__list {
    list-style: none;
    font-size: clamp(23px, 2.1vw, 30px);
    font-weight: 300;
    line-height: 1.3;
    letter-spacing: -0.015em;
  }

  .customer-questions__list li {
    padding-block: 14px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(46 32 25 / 15%);
  }

  @media (min-width: 640px) {
    .customer-questions {
      padding: 72px 32px;
    }

    .customer-questions__heading {
      font-size: 44px;
    }

    .customer-questions__statement,
    .customer-questions__closing {
      font-size: 28px;
    }

    .customer-questions__copy {
      font-size: 17px;
    }
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .customer-questions {
      padding-inline: 48px;
    }
  }

  @media (min-width: 1024px) {
    .customer-questions {
      padding: 96px 64px;
    }

    .customer-questions__inner {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 56px;
    }

    .customer-questions__heading {
      font-size: 52px;
    }

    .customer-questions__closing {
      grid-column: 1 / -1;
    }
  }
</style>
